msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Escort"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:15
msgid ""
"The Exuari Guard is an all-around escort and defense corvette. Power issues "
"cause its beam and missile systems to take longer than expected to rearm "
"after firing. The Guard is equipped with turreted beams and a diverse and "
"large stock of missiles, including homing missiles and mines."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:38
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Sentinel"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:39
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Anti-fighter"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:44
msgid ""
"The Exuari Sentinel is an anti-fighter frigate. It has several rapid-firing, "
"low-damage point-defense turret beams to quickly take out starfighters."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:61
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Warden"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:62
#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:87
msgctxt "subclass"
msgid "Artillery"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:67
msgid ""
"The Exuari Warden is a heavy artillery corvette that fires volleys of "
"missiles from forward-facing tubes. It has only a single point-defense "
"turret beam weapon."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:86
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Flash"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:92
msgid ""
"The Exuari Flash is a special artillery sniper designed to deal large "
"amounts of damage quickly and from a distance before escaping. Its simple "
"design consists of a freighter hull full of nuclear weapons, and rumors "
"suggest that the Exuari refit captured freighters into Flashes."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:106
msgctxt "ship"
msgid "Ranger"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:109
msgid ""
"The Exuari Ranger is a special artillery sniper designed to deal large "
"amounts of damage quickly and from a distance before escaping. Despite being "
"a basic design and among the smallest corvette-class ships, it also carries "
"nuclear weapons."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:120
