msgid "Buster"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/shiptemplates/exuari/corvettes.lua:124
msgid ""
"The Exuari Buster is a special artillery sniper designed to deal large "
"amounts of damage quickly and from a distance before escaping. Despite being "
"a basic design and among the smallest corvette-class ships, it also carries "
"nuclear weapons."
msgstr ""
